      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Following the re-import of the DLLs, then closing and re-opening the project, I actually discovered the VRC URL Input Field script is appearing once again.\nIt is not being assigned back to the missing script component though, so possibly its using a new hash/association. I had to manually assign this and then re-configure the component settings once again for use with the Merlin USharp Video Player. Annoying issue!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
