      "mergedPostDetails": "When working on a few projects the video players stopped working, seemingly at random, and when we checked it seemed that the VRCURLInputField script was suddenly missing. Reinstalling the SDK from VCC did not fix the issue, though we were able to get it working by having someone else send a replacement SDK that we added manually.",
